q.en:
How many of the following statements about binary trees are correct?
a. A binary tree with n nodes has height at least log2 n;
b. In any non-empty binary tree, if there are n0 leaves and n2 nodes of degree 2, then n0 = n2 + 1;
c. A binary tree of depth k has at most 2^k nodes;
d. No binary tree has the same pre-order and post-order traversal;
e. A complete binary tree with n nodes has depth ⌈log2(n+1)⌉.

q.zh:
以下關於二叉樹性質中，正確的描述的個數有( )。
a.包含n個結點的二叉樹的高度至少為log2n;
b.在任意一棵非空二叉樹中，若葉子結點的個數為n0，度為2的結點數為n2，則 n0=n2+1;
c.深度為k的二叉樹至多有2^k個結點
d.沒有一棵二叉樹的前序遍歷序列與後序遍歷序列相同
e.具有n個結點的完全二叉樹的深度為[log2[(n+1)]

