Hint: logical operators from high to low precedence: !, &&, ||. Bitwise operators from high to low: ~, &, ^, |. Binary bitwise operators have higher precedence than binary logical operators; ! and ~ have the same precedence, higher than all binary operators.

The code below computes x^n. What is its time complexity?
double quick_power(double x, unsigned int n){
  if (n==0) return 1;
  if (n==1) return x;
  return quick_power(x,n/2)*quick_power(x,n/2)*((n&1)?x:1);
}

q.zh:
現在用如下程式碼來計算x^n，其時間複雜度為( )

double quick_power(double x,unsigned int n){
if (n==0) return 1;
if (n==1) return x;
return quick_power(x,n/2)*quick_power(x,n/2)*((n&1)?x:1);
}

